# The old bot after production moved to a new one (#238), bot/moved.py.
moved-dm =
    The bot has moved: it is now <b>@{ $bot }</b>.
    Tap the button below and press "Start" — notifications and everything else will come from there. Your accounts, history and subscriptions are all kept.
moved-open = Open @{ $bot }
moved-group =
    The bot has moved: it is now <b>@{ $bot }</b>.
    Add it to this chat with the button below — nothing is posted here without it. The chat's subscriptions and history are kept.
moved-add = Add @{ $bot } to the chat
